    "fn" : {},
    "fn cannot be part of this shortcut. Choose one with ⌘, ⌥, ⌃ or ⇧." : {},
    "fn or Ctrl with the scroll wheel zooms the page." : {},
    "fn+C copies, also in terminals. Ctrl keeps its Mac meaning, and fn takes the place of its 🌐 shortcuts. %@" : {},
    "macOS can zoom the whole screen with Ctrl+scroll (Accessibility › Zoom › “Use scroll gesture with modifier keys”). If that is on, it wins and pages do not zoom: choose fn, or turn it off." : {},
    "macOS grants this together with Accessibility and may not list KeyBridge under Input Monitoring." : {},
    "macOS may ask for your password, and it locks these grants to KeyBridge's signature: a rebuild from source asks again." : {},
